{
 "encounter_id": "00766",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "FAMILY_MEMBER"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Morning, doctor. I'm Dad's daughter, Kate. He's here for his repeat prescription review, he says he feels well."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I do feel well. I don't see why we had to come. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's good to hear, Mr Sutcliffe. It's a routine check, so don't worry. How's your breathing?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine. A bit puffed on the hill, that's all."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Dad, you stop three times on the hill."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Kate, thanks for saying so. Any swelling in your ankles, Mr Sutcliffe?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A little at night, maybe. It goes by morning."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any chest pain?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. None."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Dizziness, or fainting?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Waking at night short of breath?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. I sleep like a baby."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What tablets are you taking at the moment?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Furosemide, 40 mg, once a day, in the morning. That's the water tablet."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Codeine, it makes me sick as a dog."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "He has heart failure, diagnosed two years ago, and high blood pressure."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any heart problems in the family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My father died of a heart attack at sixty."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And who looks after you at home?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I live with Kate and her husband now, since my wife died."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check you. Pulse, pressure, and your weight. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Go on. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse 74, blood pressure 128 over 76, oxygen 96 percent, weight 82 kilos.",
   "pause": 18.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Is that more than last time? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's up by two kilos from three months ago, which could be fluid. Let me look at your ankles and listen to your chest. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "There's mild swelling above both ankles, and your chest has a few crackles at the bottom of both lungs."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Is that bad? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's mild, but it fits with a little fluid build-up, so I'd say your heart failure is stable but slightly fluid-overloaded."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I feel fine. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Many people do, until it builds. I'd like to keep the same tablets for now, and ask you to weigh yourself every morning."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Should I write it down? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes, same scales, same time, after the toilet. If your weight goes up by two kilos in three days, ring us."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'll keep a chart. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Cut down on salt, and don't add any at the table."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My wife used to say that. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "She was right. I'd like to see you again in four weeks, to check your weight and your ankles."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Four weeks. Fine. Thank you. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Thanks, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
